    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        98.4140625,
        227.54033203125,
        513.5859375,
        239.51614379882812
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.377021179199229,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0020",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.9947,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "(Your team's summary should be included as the first page of your electronic submission.)"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        165.3515625,
        250.2943542480469,
        446.25,
        263.8669372558594
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 12.893953857421884,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0021",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99147,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "Type a summary of your results on this page. Do not include"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        154.1953125,
        263.4677490234375,
        456.2109375,
        275.8427490234375
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.75625,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0022",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98887,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "the name of your school, advisor, or team members on this page."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.25,
        296.2016235351563,
        543.46875,
        308.1774169921875
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.377003784179655,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0023",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99482,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "We propose a Bayesian multi-stage model to maximize Return on Investment (RI) over the next five"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.71875,
        308.975830078125,
        101.6015625,
        320.9516235351563
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.377003784179708,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0024",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.9982,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "years."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        320.9516235351563,
        543.46875,
        332.5282470703125
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398405,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0025",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98952,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "First, a model was made to relate the distribution of students' majors at a school to the expected"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        333.3266235351563,
        543.0703125,
        344.9032470703125
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398405,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0026",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99444,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "number of jobs that that school will add to to the economy. Here, we relate the unemployment outlook in"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73.3125,
        346.100830078125,
        543.46875,
        356.479833984375
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 9.860053710937478,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0027",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99729,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "each particular discipline to the percentage of students at each school pursuing that particular course of"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        357.6774169921875,
        543.0703125,
        369.25404052734376
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0028",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99422,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "study. In the case that a school was going to produce a high number of graduates in a field that is already"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        370.0524169921875,
        543.8671875,
        381.62904052734376
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0029",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98795,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "oversaturated (that is, has a high unemployment rate), it is actually assigned a negative contribution to"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        382.4274169921875,
        235.078125,
        394.00404052734376
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0030",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98693,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "the number of jobs in the economy."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        394.4032470703125,
        543.46875,
        405.979833984375
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997757568359363,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0031",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99036,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "Next, a model was fit to give the relationship between jobs added to the economy and change in real"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        405.979833984375,
        543.46875,
        418.354833984375
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.75625,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0032",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99516,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "Gross Domestic Product (GDP). This was based on a linear relationship we observed between changes"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        419.1532470703125,
        543.46875,
        430.72987060546876
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0033",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.9996,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "in logGDP and changes in unemployment, fit to data gathered beginning in 1948. This particular model"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        431.12904052734376,
        290.0625,
        442.7056640625
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398405,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0034",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99882,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "has a surprisingly good fit considering the field."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        443.10487060546876,
        542.671875,
        455.0806640625
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.377003784179655,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0035",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99445,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "Each school was given a Goodness rating based on added GDP and the median salary of its alumni."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73.3125,
        455.87904052734376,
        424.734375,
        467.4556640625
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398405,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0036",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99815,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "Salary was simply scaled and added to GDP in order to compute this metric."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        467.4556640625,
        544.265625,
        479.8306640625
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.75625,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0037",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99319,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "The centerpiece of our proposal is a linear regression model relating Goodness to a combination of"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        480.22987060546876,
        543.8671875,
        491.80645751953125
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997757568359363,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0038",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99939,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "the school's tuition and enrollment. This model is meant to contain general information about how a"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.515625,
        492.2056640625,
        252.2109375,
        503.78228759765625
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0039",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98584,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "school's resources impact its Goodness."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        504.18145751953125,
        543.46875,
        516.5564575195312
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.75625,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0040",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99739,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "The posteriors of this overall model are used as priors for the parameters of a series of models (these"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        517.3548706054687,
        543.46875,
        528.9314575195312
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997757568359418,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0041",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98682,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "priors are injected with additional variance so as not to overwhelm the data), each one fit to a particular"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        529.3306640625,
        543.46875,
        540.9072875976562
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0042",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99533,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "school. Each of these models represents a predicted relationship between a school's available funds per"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        541.7056640625,
        543.46875,
        553.2822875976562
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0043",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99544,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "student and its Goodness, as well as how a change in its funds would affect its Goodness, which we call"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        72.9140625,
        554.0806640625,
        157.3828125,
        564.4597045898438
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 9.860088500976627,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0044",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.99877,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "a Goodness curve."
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        88.0546875,
        565.2580810546875,
        542.671875,
        577.6330810546875
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 11.75625,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0045",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.98782,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "We model the investment of money in a school as increasing the \"effective tuition\" of that school,"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        73.3125,
        578.4314575195312,
        543.46875,
        590.0080810546875
      ],
      "bold": false,
      "engine": "rapidocr",
      "font_size": 10.997792358398458,
      "line_id": "p0001-ocr-l0046",
      "native_block": -1,
      "ocr_score": 0.9959,
      "page": 1,
      "spans": [],
      "text": "which will increase the Goodness of that school according to its Goodness curve. This change in Goodness"
